itle\":\"API Reference\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/v2-introduction\"}]},{\"tab\":\"Build with AI\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Build with AI\",\"href\":\"/ai-onboarding\"}]}]},{\"version\":\"v1\",\"hidden\":true,\"tabs\":[{\"tab\":\"Documentation\",\"hidden\":true,\"searchable\":true,\"groups\":[{\"group\":\"Get Started\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Introduction\",\"description\":\"The web data API for AI agents. Search the web, scrape any page, and interact with it through one API.\",\"href\":\"/introduction\"},{\"title\":\"Get Started\",\"description\":\"Set up Firecrawl MCP with keyless access, account sign-in, or an API key.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Get Started\",\"href\":\"/mcp-server\"},{\"title\":\"Advanced Scraping Guide\",\"description\":\"Configure scrape options, browser actions, crawl, map, and the agent endpoint with Firecrawl's full API surface.\",\"href\":\"/advanced-scraping-guide\"},{\"group\":\"Plans and Billing\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Billing\",\"description\":\"How Firecrawl billing, credits, and plans work\",\"href\":\"/billing\"},{\"title\":\"Rate Limits\",\"href\":\"/rate-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Partner Credits\",\"description\":\"How Firecrawl partner credits work, including eligibility, expiration, and plan limits\",\"href\":\"/partner-credits\"}]},{\"group\":\"Enterprise\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Enterprise\",\"description\":\"Enterprise plans, security, and features for Firecrawl at scale\",\"href\":\"/enterprise\"},{\"title\":\"SSO and SCIM\",\"description\":\"Set up single sign-on (SSO) and SCIM directory sync so your team signs in through your identity provider and user access stays in sync with your directory.\",\"href\":\"/features/sso\"},{\"title\":\"IP Restrictions\",\"description\":\"Restrict your team's API keys to an allowlist of IP addresses or CIDR ranges, so they only work from approved networks. Enforced server-side.\",\"href\":\"/features/ip-restrictions\"},{\"title\":\"Key Restrictions\",\"description\":\"Lock an individual API key to specific output formats and endpoints. Enforced server-side, with no way for a request to override it.\",\"href\":\"/features/key-restrictions\"},{\"title\":\"Threat Protection\",\"description\":\"Block requests to risky URLs across every endpoint, using a policy your organization controls. Enforced server-side.\",\"href\":\"/features/threat-protection\"},{\"title\":\"SIEM Audit Logging\",\"description\":\"Stream a structured audit event for every scrape your team runs to your own SIEM, starting with Microsoft Sentinel. Delivered server-side.\",\"href\":\"/features/siem\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"New Features\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Agent\",\"icon\":\"magic\",\"hidden\":true,\"pages\":[]}]},{\"group\":\"Standard Features\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Scrape\",\"icon\":\"markdown\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Scrape\",\"description\":\"Turn any url into clean data\",\"href\":\"/features/scrape\"},{\"title\":\"Faster Scraping\",\"description\":\"Speed up your scrapes by 500% with the maxAge parameter\",\"href\":\"/features/fast-scraping\"},{\"title\":\"Batch Scrape\",\"description\":\"Scrape multiple URLs in a single batch job\",\"href\":\"/features/batch-scrape\"},{\"title\":\"JSON mode - Structured result\",\"description\":\"Extract structured data from pages via LLMs\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"JSON mode\",\"href\":\"/features/llm-extract\"},{\"title\":\"Change Tracking\",\"description\":\"Detect and monitor changes in web content between scrapes\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Change Tracking\",\"href\":\"/features/change-tracking\"},{\"title\":\"Enhanced Mode\",\"description\":\"Use enhanced proxies for reliable scraping on complex sites\",\"href\":\"/features/enhanced-mode\"},{\"title\":\"Proxies\",\"description\":\"Learn about proxy types, locations, and how Firecrawl selects proxies for your requests.\",\"href\":\"/features/proxies\"}]},{\"title\":\"Crawl\",\"description\":\"Recursively crawl a website and get content from every page\",\"icon\":\"spider\",\"href\":\"/features/crawl\"},{\"t